WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.740
Turn one paper result into a useful learning
reflection.

00:00:05.598 --> 00:00:09.268
After a practice close, open Journal beneath
the chart.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.370
Start with the newest close at the top.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.350
Read the trade direction and instrument
together.

00:00:17.223 --> 00:00:18.953
Check the volume that was closed.

00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:24.793
Then read the paper result. Profit alone
proves little.

00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:29.152
A partial close can create another row for
one position.

00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:34.485
For a learning record, use your Academy
lesson's practice notes.

00:00:35.348 --> 00:00:37.938
Write one thing you would review next time.

00:00:38.848 --> 00:00:42.518
Save your reflection, and ask a lesson
question if needed.
